From: Hank Yeomans <hank@quorra.taile7bcb.ts.net>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:10:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 59/60] ngram_worker: chain-only verify for pools without
 move_kv_cache (DeepSeek-V4; recipe T3.9h-b)

DeepSeekV4TokenToKVPool cannot compact a branched accept path and the DSV4
attention backend ignores custom_mask (verify rows attend causally), so on
such pools the worker rewrites every draft into a front chain (leading run
of parent==previous, non-zero tokens; causal mask), skips
move_accept_tokens_to_target_kvcache, clears the offline C128 slots of the
rejected rows like the EAGLE/DSpark path, and refuses a bfs breadth != 1.
SGLANG_ENABLE_ASYNC_ASSERT adds an async check that the accepted rows are
the leading rows of each window.

Amp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a0c10b-a5f8-77fc-b238-7147d12ccf29
Co-authored-by: Amp <amp@ampcode.com>
